{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地男神井柏然自劇集《早春晴朗》後翻身爆紅，不少劇迷都對他下部作品抱熱熾期望，而他夥拍好戲之人張頌文合演的新劇《谷雨》明日（5號）終於推出，引來不少粉絲慕名預約，至今預約人數已逾百萬。</p><p>戲中井柏然扮演90年代的稅務調查員，與「騙稅商人」張頌文</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T05:04:59.244071+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T04:06:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T04:58:23.633639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T04:58:23.633639+00:00","content_hash":"7a378fc4cd3d4f66e8604037800f3196e852c5daa842c4dcf16b5d0dc33172a0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}